---
title: Current recovery — restore knowledge before control
---
stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: Current operator recovery workflow
  accDescr: Startup, an uncertain transport outcome or any stopped walk requires reconciliation. A retained walk observation is evidence, not current authority. After a fresh eligible observation, remote dispatch stays paused until explicit resume succeeds. Pause or native input disables further dispatch. A pending request can still time out while paused. Pause does not cancel an already-running game activity; native interruption may be necessary. No recovery path automatically replays an action.
  direction TB
  state "Reconciliation required" as Frozen
  state "Remote dispatch paused" as Paused
  state "Remote dispatch enabled" as Enabled
  [*] --> Frozen: Controller starts or restarts
  Frozen --> Paused: Eligible observe succeeds after any pending deadline
  Paused --> Enabled: Explicit resume accepted with current authority
  Enabled --> Paused: Pause or native takeover
  Enabled --> Frozen: Dispatch outcome unknown or walk stopped
  Paused --> Frozen: Pending input times out or transport fails
  note right of Frozen
    Observe and interpret current state.
    Never replay uncertain input.
  end note
  note right of Paused
    Existing activity can continue.
    Use native interruption if needed.
  end note
